Lab Console
version: 1.5.0
date: 2026-11-18
tree: lab-console/

Feature set at this version:
  - MQTT monitor + control (pause/resume/stop/light/start-print)
  - Per-model camera relay (RTSPS :322 for X1C/H2D, chamber :6000 for A1)
  - FTPS SD listing + upload, passive SSDP discovery
  - Demo mode (server.py --demo)
  - In-app Technical Archive at /docs (4 pages)
  - PDF manual (build_manual.py -> static/docs/LabConsole-Manual.pdf)
  - ERROR state wording + flashing red bezel; white LIVE camera tag
  - Printers may stay on Bambu Cloud (local status + camera; some commands may be refused)
  - Resting vector animations on every non-fault panel, printing included
  - lab-console.log: rotating log of commands, printer replies, connection/camera errors
  - Only HMS error/warning levels raise ERROR; info notices are logged
  - Two-across fleet layout on wide screens, with a progress reticle on large panels (1.5)
  - Detail view fills the screen; prominent way back to the fleet (1.5)
  - Layer stack face, alternating with the ambient instruments while printing/paused (1.5)

If any of the above is missing from your working tree, you have an outdated
copy. See the FILE MANIFEST section of CLAUDE.md to verify.
